  "title": "Ask for a Pony, Get a Ferrari: Good Times for Global Convertibles",
  "summary": "Calamos Global Convertible Fund (CXGCX) gained 14.5% in Q2, outperforming both the FTSE Global Convertible Index and MSCI World Index. Record convertible issuance, led by Alphabet's $19.3 billion deal, created opportunities to rebalance. The team remains optimistic but cautious given geopolitical uncertainty and late-cycle risks ahead.",
